# Career content: never committed, even locally (PRD principle 8)
# Leading slash anchors these to the repo root. Without it, a trailing-slash-only
# pattern matches at ANY depth and also swallows the fictional test fixtures under
# scripts/test-data/. landing/* and capture/node_modules/ already carry a mid-path
# separator, so they are root-anchored by gitignore's own rules.
/opportunities/
networking/
landing/*
!landing/_ledger.md
!landing/_runs.md
!landing/README.md
!landing/web-captures/
landing/web-captures/*
!landing/web-captures/README.md
/data/
capture/node_modules/

# Generated surfaces: schema/stub committed, live payloads regenerated
out/digest.md

# Secrets: never committed; supply token values via the environment or a local
# untracked file (gap named in the 2026-07-14 Codex secret-policy session)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Session usage reports: embed prompt texts from all projects, local only
session-report-*.html

# OS noise
.DS_Store

# Claude Code worktrees
.claude/worktrees/

# Local guard telemetry, never commit run history.
.claude/metrics/

# Transient mutual-exclusion state for local jd-intake runs.
.jobsearchos-runtime/
